z1WY7HigPvYA6esw.png"><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p><span>1、有需要的朋友，可通过以下3种方式领取大公鸡播客专属购买福利：</span><br><span>点击专属购买链接直接下单</span></p><p><span>淘宝：</span><a href="https://mo.m.tmall.com/page/38180310?shop_id=355057106&amp;item_id=961218260731" data-url="https://mo.m.tmall.com/page/38180310?shop_id=355057106&amp;item_id=961218260731"><span>mo.m.tmall.com</span></a></p><p><span>京东：</span><a href="https://pro.m.jd.com/mall/active/2h37P5u46Shz9sv5w2ukPV9HKa88/index.html" data-url="https://pro.m.jd.com/mall/active/2h37P5u46Shz9sv5w2ukPV9HKa88/index.html"><span>pro.m.jd.com</span></a></p><p><span>2、复制淘口令进入淘宝购买：18￥9kQdTsUh4zJ￥/ &nbsp;HU591</span></p><p><span>3、淘宝搜索“大宇除螨仪”，进入【大宇清洁电器旗舰店】，联系客服并回复暗号“大公鸡播客”，即可获取专属购买链接。</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p></p><p><br></p>]]></description>
